{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/pulls/2510", "id": 4839428345, "node_id": "PR_kwDOT7ZWI88AAAABIHPQ-Q", "html_url": "https://github.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/pull/2510", "diff_url": "https://github.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/pull/2510.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/pull/2510.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/issues/2510", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/pulls/2510/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/pulls/2510/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/issues/2510/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER/statuses/58a619dfe3c6da291f339e579dd30ff862c191fd", "number": 2510, "state": "open", "locked": false, "title": "fix(learning): rebuild #2012 GitHub-projection 403 diagnostic on current main (B-37)", "user": {"login": "SoulSchoolAcademy", "id": 221210320, "node_id": "U_kgDODS9m0A", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221210320?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/SoulSchoolAcademy", "html_url": "https://github.com/SoulSchoolAcademy", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SoulSchoolAcademy/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SoulSchoolAcademy/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SoulSchoolAcademy/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SoulSchoolAcademy/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SoulSchoolAcademy/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SoulSchoolAcademy/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SoulSchoolAcademy/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SoulSchoolAcademy/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SoulSchoolAcademy/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Seat: Naya 2\n\n## Purpose\n\nB-37: rebuild PR #2012's closed-unmerged GitHub-projection 403 diagnostic against current main.\n\nThe canonical Smart Note learning path persists OK, but the GitHub Contents-API projection fails with `GITHUB_COMMIT_FAILED:403` \u2014 and the durable receipt stores only the HTTP status, losing GitHub's own rejection reason. A status code alone cannot distinguish missing Contents permission, installation scope, SSO policy, or branch/ruleset denial. This patch preserves a sanitized, bounded reason in both the durable failure receipt (`GITHUB_COMMIT_FAILED:<status>:<reason>`) and the immediate response. Diagnostic-only: it does not fix the 403 itself.\n\n## Change\n\n- `supabase/functions/nayanet-github-dispatch/index.ts`: new pure helper `sanitizeGithubReason()` \u2014 printable-ASCII only, `Authorization: Bearer` redacted (nospace form too), raw `ghp_`/`ghs_`/`github_pat_` token shapes redacted, 240-char bound, `UNKNOWN` fallback. The PUT-failure branch now writes the full receipt context (`status`, `failure`, `authority_grant_id`, `intelligent_block_id`, `repo_path`, `smart_link`) mirroring the credential-failure path's existing precedent, and the response `detail` reuses the sanitized reason.\n- `tests/github_dispatch_contract.test.mjs`: 5 new contract tests (rejection persists sanitized reason + target context; 240-char bound; empty-message `UNKNOWN` fallback; nospace-bearer + raw-token redaction; 422-status unicode/control-char sanitization). The 10 pre-existing tests are byte-identical.\n- `.github/workflows/learning-projection-diagnostic.yml`: runs the contract tests on pull_request (path-filtered) + workflow_dispatch.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Contract suite: 15/15 pass locally (`node --test tests/github_dispatch_contract.test.mjs`, node 24.20.0) against these exact bytes.\n- Negative control: the 5 new tests fail against the pristine tip handler while the 10 pre-existing pass \u2014 the tests discriminate the defect.\n- Independent scorer batteries: 25-case (round 1) + 23-case (round 2) + 16-case (round 3) adversarial runs against the sanitizer, all green; bearer/token bypasses closed and re-proven.\n- Builder-scorer loop, distinct scorer, 3 rounds: 9.0 \u2192 10 \u2192 10 SHIP.\n- Pushed bytes byte-identical to scored bytes (verified via contents API on the branch before opening).\n- No duplicate mechanism: `REDACTED` appears only inside `sanitizeGithubReason`, called exactly once; `normalizedText` reused in-file; no existing sanitizer in `supabase/functions/`.\n- Success path untouched: happy-path and idempotent-replay behavior byte-identical; no machine consumer parses `detail` or the `failure` string.\n\n## Truth status\n\nDiagnostic patch, not a fix for the 403 itself. The actual permission/ruleset repair still needs the authorized end-to-end capture with a fresh idempotency key, `PROJECTION_VERIFIED`, Smart Link, and cold retrieval. Never self-merged \u2014 awaiting independent-seat scorecard + merge discipline.\n", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2026-10-13T06:42:13Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T06:42:23Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "a75b053085038e4c30525018f7d2c3f2fa568897", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "SoulSchoolAcademy:naya2/b37-projection-403-diagnostic", "ref": "naya2/b37-projection-403-diagnostic", "repo": {"id": 1337349667, "node_id": "R_kgDOT7ZWIw", "name": "NayaPOWER", "full_name": "SoulSchoolAcademy/NayaPOWER", "owner": {"login": "SoulSchoolAcademy", "id": 221210320, "node_id": "U_kgDODS9m0A", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221210320?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Soul